  <item>
    <title>North Port: data center moratorium — Proposed</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/north-port-fl</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-north-port-fl</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>City Commission voted 4-1 on first reading of an 18-month moratorium on data center applications, following 7 hours of public comment with nearly all speakers opposed. Final vote expected September 22, 2026. Triggered by a data center application filed just hours before the moratorium discussion.</description>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Volusia County: data center moratorium — Proposed</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/volusia-county-fl</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-volusia-county-fl</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>County Council directed staff to draft a permanent ban on large-scale data centers in unincorporated areas, moving beyond an initial six-month moratorium proposal. The ban ordinance must go through the Planning Commission and two public hearings before formal adoption. New data center applications are not being accepted in the interim.</description>
  </item>
